### POST
### ─────────────────────────────────────────

### Create avg health readings for driver (system authorization)

POST http://localhost:3000/api/avg-health-readings/6
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer SYSTEM_TOKEN

{
    "heartRate": "60",
    "temp": "36"
}


### Create avg health readings for driver (other than system authorization) - should fail

POST http://localhost:3000/api/avg-health-readings/6
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer DRIVER_TOKEN

{
    "heartRate": "60",
    "temp": "36"
}



